.TH DANBY-REENTRY 1
.SH NAME
danby-reentry \- atmospheric re-entry trajectory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/reentry
.SH MODEL
Entry speed and angle feed an exponential-atmosphere drag model with optional
lift. The path displays the narrow corridor between skip-out and steep descent.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/reentry.b
